he option to  use teleport movement to keep you from  getting motion sick the thing where you  just pointed objects and yoink them  towards you out of half-life alex and  you can full-on be clumsy and lose your  gun on the ground and just pull another  one out of your backpack the x-ray kill  cam from the main elite series is here  and it totally works as with other vr  titles having to mechanically operate  and reload a vr gun under pressure is a  lot of fun being able to rotate and  fully examine your rifle in your hands  it's something you just can't do on a 2d  screen the sniper elite vr title also  properly translates difficulty from the  base series and it's pretty hard to  brute force your way through with an smg  or an assault rifle because the base  damage is tuned down versus one hit kill  sniper rifles if you're able to overcome  the limitations of vr as always it's  just a cooler more immersive experience  that doesn't necessarily mean better it  just means more present if that makes  sense i really started to enjoy this  game after a couple of levels how  realistic is the sniping the actual  shooting is pretty casual and forgiving  but unlike all the other titles above  you'll be physically aiming manipulating  the gun mechanically operating the bolt  doing simple reloading mechanics all  while being shot at operating the  mechanics of a sniper rifle under  pressure is just something you don't get  outside of er the game is more for  people looking for the novelty of vr and  who can afford the setup it can be very  expensive to get into vr it doesn't add  enough on its own to run out and buy all  the gear but if you already have it you  can have an experience that you just  don't get elsewhere and vr still being  developed it has a lot of potential  it was honestly hard to get this list  down because there are so many great  examples of sniping in video games  there's pretty much something for  everyone depending on what you're  looking for one i had to cut but i want  to just give a big shout out to you  anyway is america's army was this like  tough free great sim that lasted for a  lot of years and i spent a ton of hours  in particular sniping on the snake plane  map so let us know what you're playing  and what you'd like to see next and  honestly let us know what we got right  here and what we got wrong if you play  these games we read the comments and we  use that in our videos alright thanks  for watching everyone  you
 

